, not a runtime state).  - ONLY ACTIVE rows count in the denominator (rows for other states do not dilute the roll).  - `position` (grounded/surface/submerged) is placement context only (spawn Y-level) and never modifies the roll.  - Weight 0 = event/trigger spawn (not rolled).  - 'chance per spawn roll, given the row's condition holds' is what helps you WHERE + WHEN to go hunt;    spawn_weights.json is the single odds source; `examples/spawn_odds.py` computes exactly this for any    pok\u00e9mon (plain rows are sampled in a dry-day state; pools mix day- and night-gated pok\u00e9mon, so    plain rows may differ slightly between day and night).","sources":[{"label":"mods/CobbleDollars-fabric-2.0.0+Beta-5.1+1.21.1.jar","tier":1,"kind":"locked-mod","sha1":"48a2a30fb22e088ca9357fc95bdb4247ddc80b17","url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/s7N7AsqL/versions/cqsHXSXe/CobbleDollars-fabric-2.0.0%2BBeta-5.1%2B1.21.1.jar","biome_tags":1},{"label":"mods/CobbleFurnies-fabric-1.2.jar","tier":1,"kind":"locked-mod","sha1":"a71f20907c3350680a11054584cf96963f5875e5","url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AXY1OO9m/versions/54k31lEX/CobbleFurnies-fabric-1.2.jar"},{"label":"mods/Cobblemon-fabric-1.7.3+1.21.1.jar","tier":1,"kind":"locked-mod","sha1":"f192cda3fdfec0f20d1dee1887ec1b9e77b1618c","url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/MdwFAVRL/versions/kF7CvxTo/Cobblemon-fabric-1.7.3%2B1.21.1.jar","pools":824,"biome_tags":185,"presets":28,"spawner_cfg":1,"species":1025,"lang":28},{"label":"mods/CobbleverseBadges-1.3.jar","tier":1,"kind":"locked-mod","sha1":"8e213de6013b6a58485ba8ddfcff5c91b3beb41d","url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/PHT3Zj0r/versions/3aQ0cMqp/CobbleverseBadges-1.3.jar"},{"label":"mods/Cobbreeding-fabric-2.2.2.jar","tier":1,"kind":"locked-mod","sha1":"0bd4a004af1de1d0929dfd295db044c365351153","url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/ItmVb4zY/versions/RNbPHodv/Cobbreeding-fabric-2.2.2.jar"},{"label":"mods/LegendaryMonuments-Cobbleverse.jar","tier":1,"kind":"locked-mod","sha1":"9c86e9dfd